<card id="c" title="What&apos;s on My Raspberry Pi 5">
<do type="prev" label="Back"><prev/></do>
<p>I ordered it from the official distributor, who delivers to Serbia - <a href="https://www.rs.galagomarket.com//item/display/3746?src=raspberrypi">GalagoMarket</a>. Delivery from Slovenia took a little more than 2 weeks.</p>
<p><i>P.s. At the time, I didn’t know that the import tax to Serbia is 30% if the item&apos;s price exceeds 50 euros.</i></p>
<p><b>Package Contents</b></p>
<p>I decided to order the full set so I wouldn&apos;t have to deal with additional parts:</p>
<p>- <b><a href="https://www.rs.galagomarket.com//item/display/3746?src=raspberrypi">RASPBERRY PI 5, 8GB</a>;</b></p>
<p>- <b>Case <a href="https://www.rs.galagomarket.com/item/display/3750">RASPBERRY PI 5 CASE, WHITE/RED</a></b> <i>(P.S. It&apos;s better not to put on the top cover to prevent overheating);</i></p>
